      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start but i think it might be a little too \"light\" for what the supervisor is looking for. the density score is looking a bit low on this draft, and i'm worried it might get flagged as a \"surface-level\" summary.\n\ncan you expand on this? i need more detail on the actual biochemical interactions—the specific parts of the lipid structure, the endosomal pathway stages, and the molecular mechanisms of the membrane destabilization. try to make it much more technical and \"dense.\" just make sure it still makes sense and stays accurate, i don't want it to look like we're just trying to pad the word count with jargon.",
